<title>TURKEY: Turkish Airlines to start flights to Johannesburg.</title>
<headline>Turkish Airlines to start flights to Johannesburg.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish national carrier Turkish Airlines said it would start flights between Istanbul and Johannesburg.</p>
<p>Turkish Airlines will fly to Johannesburg on Mondays and Fridays and will depart from Johannesburg on Tuesdays and Saturdays with Airbus A 310-300 from October 28, 1996. --Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
